or.</h2><p class=\"season-deck\">Shakespeare was baptised in Stratford on 26 April 1564 and died on 23 April 1616, and 23 April is kept as his birthday. The library has all thirty-seven plays, the Sonnets and the narrative poems.</p><div class=\"season-hero-actions\"><a class=\"season-button\" href=\"/shakespeare/\">Explore the Shakespeare collection <span aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span></a><a href=\"/seasons/\">All nine seasons</a></div><p class=\"season-period\">18–25 April</p></div><div class=\"season-art\"><svg class=\"season-scene\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 600\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" ><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"116\" r=\"78\" fill=\"#f4dc8c\" opacity=\".12\"/><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"116\" r=\"52\" fill=\"#f3d983\"/><path d=\"M-4 58Q120 70 196 150T300 236\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7a5a3e\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M118 82Q160 50 214 52M196 150Q236 128 262 92M88 66Q96 30 132 14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7a5a3e\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><g transform=\"translate(44 62) rotate(0) scale(0.95)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#fbe7ea\" transform=\"rotate(0)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#fbe7ea\" transform=\"rotate(72)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#fbe7ea\" transform=\"rotate(144)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#fbe7ea\" transform=\"rotate(216)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#fbe7ea\" transform=\"rotate(288)\"/><circle r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#d98c3a\"/></g><g transform=\"translate(96 92) rotate(23) scale(0.8)\"><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#f5cbd3\" transform=\"rotate(0)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#f5cbd3\" transform=\"rotate(72)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\" fill=\"#f5cbd3\" transform=\"rotate(144)\"/><ellipse cx=\"0\" cy=\"-12\" rx=\"8.5\" ry=\"12\